---
import GoogleSourcePreferences from './GoogleSourcePreferences.astro';
---

<footer class="bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10">
      
      <!-- Brand & Summary (Col 1 & 2) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight">Sriwijaya Massage Palembang</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-orange-400">Jasa Pijat Panggilan Resmi & Profesional 24 Jam</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed pr-4">
          Penyedia jasa terapi kebugaran, urut tradisional Nusantara, reflexology, dan spa portabel langsung ke rumah, hotel berbintang, indekos, dan apartemen di seluruh wilayah Kota Palembang.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-300">
          <p><strong class="text-white">Alamat Hub:</strong> Jl. Jenderal Sudirman No. 128, Sekip Jaya, Kec. Kemuning, Palembang</p>
          <p><strong class="text-white">Sistem Reservasi:</strong> Formulir Booking Mandiri Online 24 Jam</p>
          <p><strong class="text-white">Legalitas:</strong> STPT Dinas Kesehatan Kota Palembang & Sertifikasi BNSP Spa</p>
        </div>

        <GoogleSourcePreferences />
      </div>

      <!-- Layanan Utama Money Pages (Col 3) -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Layanan Utama</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/layanan/pijat-tradisional/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Tradisional Full Body</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/pijat-refleksi/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Refleksi & Dry Massage</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/pijat-panggilan-ke-rumah/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Panggilan ke Rumah</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/pijat-panggilan-hotel-24-jam/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Hotel On-Call 24 Jam</a></li>
          <li><a href="/layanan/body-scrub-kerokan/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Lulur Scrub & Kerokan Higienis</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tarif/" class="text-orange-400 font-semibold hover:underline">Lihat Rincian Tarif Resmi →</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Preferensi & Area (Col 4) -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Terapis & Area</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/terapis/pria/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Terapis Pria Profesional</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terapis/wanita/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Terapis Wanita (Keluarga/Syar'i)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/area/ilir-timur/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Area Ilir Timur & Sudirman</a></li>
          <li><a href="/area/ilir-barat/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Area Ilir Barat & Polygon</a></li>
          <li><a href="/area/sukarami-bandara/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Sukarami & Bandara SMB II</a></li>
          <li><a href="/area/seberang-ulu-jakabaring/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pijat Jakabaring & Plaju</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Legalitas & Etika (Col 5) -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Keamanan & Etika</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-rose-400">PERNYATAAN TEGAS:</strong> Kami adalah jasa terapi kebugaran resmi keluarga. Kami <strong>MENOLAK KERAS</strong> segala bentuk layanan asusila, vitalitas berbahaya, dan tindakan melanggar norma hukum.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm pt-2">
          <li><a href="/tentang-kami/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Tentang Kami</a></li>
          <li><a href="/syarat-ketentuan/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">SOP & Syarat Ketentuan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Blog Edukasi Kesehatan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/kontak/" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Pemesanan WhatsApp</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Line Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-800 text-xs text-gray-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p>© 2026 Sriwijaya Massage Palembang. Hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Kota Palembang, Sumatera Selatan</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/syarat-ketentuan/" class="hover:text-gray-400">Kode Etik Terapi</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
